        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>When the graph has a ticked field, duplicate its params onto Outer and replace those strings with provider text. OutOwned is every duplicate, including when resolution fails, so the caller can root or destroy them. A graph with no ticked field is copied by value and OutOwned stays empty. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
